WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.800
In the Clip-launch layout, the Device view shows a track's devices in a row.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:14.600
Click a track, here the Chords: its instrument first, then its effects.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.400
Drag an effect from the Browser's Audio Effects onto the chain.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:26.400
The signal flows left to right. Each device shows its main knobs.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:32.400
Its window button opens the full editor. Ctrl+C and Ctrl+V copy a device.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:38.200
Press Play: the chords now go through Echoform.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:44.400
Ctrl+Alt+4 shows the Device view; Shift+Tab switches to the clip.
